 "parent_tag": "01LG", "placeholders": {"ITEMCLOSE_0001": "]", "ITEMCLOSE_0002": "]", "ITEMOPEN_0001": "\\item[", "ITEMOPEN_0002": "\\item[", "LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-relative-glueing}", "MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$U \\in \\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0005": "$f_U : X_U \\to U$", "MATH_0006": "$U$", "MATH_0007": "$U, V \\in \\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0008": "$V \\subset U$", "MATH_0009": "$\\rho^U_V : X_V \\to X_U$", "MATH_0010": "$U$", "MATH_0011": "$\\rho^U_V$", "MATH_0012": "$X_V \\to f_U^{-1}(V)$", "MATH_0013": "$V$", "MATH_0014": "$W, V, U \\in \\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0015": "$W \\subset V \\subset U$", "MATH_0016": "$\\rho^U_W = \\rho^U_V \\circ \\rho ^V_W$", "MATH_0017": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0018": "$i_U : f^{-1}(U) \\to X_U$", "MATH_0019": "$U \\in \\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0020": "$V, U \\in \\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0021": "$V \\subset U$", "MATH_0022": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nX_V \\ar[r]^{i_V^{-1}} &\nf^{-1}(V) \\ar[rr]^{inclusion} & &\nf^{-1}(U) \\ar[r]^{i_U} &\nX_U\n}\n$$", "MATH_0023": "$\\rho^U_V$", "MATH_0024": "$X$", "MATH_0025": "$S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0006": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0007": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0008": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:bc2df1b2c651d636ad3416ff33a8fa5b1637b5c20c289215383b585eac8e7f17", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:267760344c113f6463ab56fa70368e0068deae5dd5ef0bbe867d9748ea8fa42f", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a scheme.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a basis for the topology of <MATH_0003>.\nSuppose given the following data:\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> For every <MATH_0004> a scheme <MATH_0005> over <MATH_0006>.\n<STRUCT_0004> For <MATH_0007> with <MATH_0008> a morphism\n<MATH_0009> over <MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nAssume that\n<STRUCT_0006>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(a)<ITEMCLOSE_0001> each <MATH_0011> induces an isomorphism\n<MATH_0012> of schemes over <MATH_0013>,\n<ITEMOPEN_0002>(b)<ITEMCLOSE_0002> whenever <MATH_0014>, with\n<MATH_0015> we have <MATH_0016>.\n<STRUCT_0007>\nThen there exists a morphism <MATH_0017> of schemes\nand isomorphisms <MATH_0018> over <MATH_0019>\nsuch that for <MATH_0020> with <MATH_0021> the composition\n<MATH_0022>\nis the morphism <MATH_0023>. Moreover <MATH_0024> is unique up to\nunique isomorphism over <MATH_0025>.\n<STRUCT_0008>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:30af45868aa9aad27c7df34add151d8b845e86aaa329136bde57dcb214b50850", "unit_id": "inventory:constructions:01LH:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:7530a28a8b9d2e74aad4b25992b5b2a19223f50e3d05d67944d280e25fc93dc8", "hash": "sha256:7530a28a8b9d2e74aad4b25992b5b2a19223f50e3d05d67944d280e25fc93dc8", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 121248, "byte_start": 121091, "file": "constructions.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:bb6238e1fd492ac8eb4261dc8d7b7693b9952e309e55cce354cb9681b8b2c554", "line_end": 3366, "line_start": 3362}, "owner_tag": "01NN", "parent_tag": "01NM", "requested_label": "constructions-situation-relative-proj", "requested_tag": "01NN", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "constructions", "node_kind": "situation", "parent_tag": "01NM", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{situation-relative-proj}", "MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{situation}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{situation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f445a8904448832316d8e70afe7c22c7c7697dc7c8c12c80012b5e9013dd1d4e", "source_status": "CU